# U35: item list items as display items (SetDisplayItem with the item's id, no normalise): a
# corrupted magic bow with a crafted explicit (sockets and links from UpdateSocketControls, the
# custom modifier row from UpdateCustomControls: its Remove button, label and "Crafted:" tag);
# Remove it (the onClick: t_remove, BuildAndParseRaw, CreateDisplayItemFromRaw, the id kept, the
# row hidden again); then a rare ring with a crafted enchant and a crafted explicit (one row,
# after four other explicits: the captured index 5); remove it.
#! u35-expect display: Upgraded Thicket Bow
#! u35-expect ^7exp +8% to Quality of Socketed Gems C
#! u35-expect display: Blight Whorl
#! u35-expect  ^7Crafted:
fixture userdir=user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/u35_items.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 800 70
click LEFTBUTTON
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 4
move 1270 700
frames 2
move 832 216
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 500 102
click LEFTBUTTON
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 4
move 1270 700
frames 2
move 832 160
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 1270 700
frames 2
